    "body": "Compiled with latest SDK (2024-04-07) - 9.00 compatible\r\n\r\nPut safe.PS4UPDATE.PUP to USB0 and run payload\r\n\r\nThis will output a number of files (depending if a normal or a recovery update):\r\n* `/mnt/usb0/PS4UPDATE1.PUP.dec`\r\n* `/mnt/usb0/PS4UPDATE2.PUP.dec`\r\n* `/mnt/usb0/PS4UPDATE3.PUP.dec`\r\n* `/mnt/usb0/PS4UPDATE4.PUP.dec`\r\n\r\nThese decrypted updates can then be unpacked using [pup-unpack](https://github.com/idc/ps4-pup_unpack/)."
